<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40750" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίρροθ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>coming to the rescue</i>;
			as Subst., <i>helper</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοίη οἱ ἐ. ἦεν Ἀθήνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					4.390
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεὰ . . , μοι ἐ. ἐλθὲ ποδοῖιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					23.770
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μακραὶ ἐπίρροθοι εὐφρόναι εἰσίν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					560
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίρροθοι ἄμμι πέλεσθε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					2.1193
				</span></i>
			: also as Adj., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῆτις</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πύργος ἐ.</span>,
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				1068
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.1045
			</span></i>: c. gen., <i>giving aid against</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νύκτερον τέλος</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> . . ἀλγέων ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				368
			</span></i> (lyr.); cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιτάρροθος</span>.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁδὸς] λείη καὶ</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ</span>. <i>easy</i> (?), <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.50
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Archim.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. κακά</span> reproaches <i>bandied</i>
			<i>backwards and forwards, abusive</i> language, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				413
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δώμαθ᾽</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> . . ἐ</span>. <i>full of
			fault-finding</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				583.10
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
